# Purpose: move, shift, type, cancel and reopen the shared keyboard without saving.
# Expect: capture_changed:initial=selected_w, capture_changed:selected_w=shifted
# Expect: semantic:initial:value_label=save_as_name
# Equality after reopening is checked by script/ux_assert_capture_equal.py.
